=== ns-1: COUNT(*) over the full mix (promoted to all-INNER) ===
== Query ==
SELECT COUNT(*) AS c
FROM nestp AS t
LEFT JOIN customer AS cl ON cl.c_custkey = t.ref
JOIN nation AS n ON n.n_nationkey = cl.c_nationkey;

Number of output lines, including header: 2

